  "audio": "public/audio/convex-mirror-warning.wav",
  "duration": 23.168,
  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "On an American car the passenger side mirror",
      "start": 0.071,
      "end": 1.965
    },
    {
      "text": "is curved,",
      "start": 2.018,
      "end": 2.554
    },
    {
      "text": "the driver's side one is flat,",
      "start": 2.694,
      "end": 3.926
    },
    {
      "text": "and only the curved one carries a warning printed",
      "start": 4.149,
      "end": 6.078
    },
    {
      "text": "on the glass.",
      "start": 6.114,
      "end": 6.685
    },
    {
      "text": "Curving a mirror squeezes a wider slice of",
      "start": 7.007,
      "end": 8.954
    },
    {
      "text": "road into the same piece of glass,",
      "start": 9.043,
      "end": 10.509
    },
    {
      "text": "which is how it covers a blind spot a",
      "start": 10.751,
      "end": 12.215
    },
    {
      "text": "flat mirror cannot reach.",
      "start": 12.251,
      "end": 13.573
    },
    {
      "text": "The price is that everything in it looks smaller,",
      "start": 13.857,
      "end": 15.858
    },
    {
      "text": "and your brain reads smaller as further away.",
      "start": 16.108,
      "end": 17.931
    },
    {
      "text": "The warning exists because the mirror really",
      "start": 18.231,
      "end": 20.035
    },
    {
      "text": "is misleading you,",
      "start": 20.054,
      "end": 20.731
    },
    {
      "text": "and someone decided that had to be admitted",
      "start": 20.949,
      "end": 22.503
    },
    {
      "text": "in writing.",
      "start": 22.521,
      "end": 23.057
    }
  ],
